{
 "cases": [
  {
   "id": "a-minor-upgrade-is-tried-on-a-branch-and-kept",
   "about": "requests has a minor upgrade and flask a major: requests is raised on a branch of its own, its tests pass, it is committed and never pushed; flask is listed, not tried.",
   "inputs": {
    "folder": "app"
   },
   "world": {
    "files": {
     "app/requirements.txt": "requests==2.31.0\nflask==2.3.3\n"
    },
    "shell": [
     {
      "match": "git checkout -b",
      "output": "Switched to a new branch 'dependency-watch/2026-10-27'"
     },
     {
      "match": "pip install -r",
      "output": "12 passed in 1.3s"
     },
     {
      "match": "git commit",
      "output": "[dependency-watch/2026-10-27 1a2b3c4] Upgrade requests (dependency-watch)\n 1 file changed"
     },
     {
      "match": "git push",
      "output": "pushed"
     },
     {
      "match": "pip list --outdated",
      "output": "requirements.txt\napp.py\ntests\n[{\"name\": \"requests\", \"version\": \"2.31.0\", \"latest_version\": \"2.32.3\"}, {\"name\": \"flask\", \"version\": \"2.3.3\", \"latest_version\": \"3.0.3\"}]\n12 passed in 1.2s"
     }
    ]
   },
   "script": [
    {
     "call": [
      [
       "bash",
       {
        "command": "cd \"$PANTHEON_PROJECTS\"/'app' && git status --porcelain && ls && .venv/bin/pip list --outdated --format=json && pytest -q 2>&1 | tail -3"
       }
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "call": [
      [
       "bash",
       {
        "command": "cd \"$PANTHEON_PROJECTS\"/'app' && git checkout -b dependency-watch/2026-10-27"
       }
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "call": [
      [
       "read_file",
       {
        "path": "app/requirements.txt"
       }
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "call": [
      [
       "edit_file",
       {
        "path": "app/requirements.txt",
        "old_string": "requests==2.31.0",
        "new_string": "requests==2.32.3"
       }
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "call": [
      [
       "bash",
       {
        "command": "cd \"$PANTHEON_PROJECTS\"/'app' && .venv/bin/pip install -r requirements.txt -q && pytest -q 2>&1 | tail -3"
       }
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "call": [
      [
       "bash",
       {
        "command": "cd \"$PANTHEON_PROJECTS\"/'app' && git commit -am 'Upgrade requests (dependency-watch)'"
       }
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": "**Outdated**\n- requests — 2.31.0 → 2.32.3 — minor\n- flask — 2.3.3 → 3.0.3 — major — not tried\n\n**Vulnerable**\n- nothing\n\n**Tried**\n- branch dependency-watch/2026-10-27\n- requests 2.31.0 → 2.32.3 — 12 passed — kept, committed\n\n## Report\n- found 2 outdated, tried 1 on dependency-watch/2026-10-27, committed; did not push\n\n## Carry forward\n- flask 3.x is waiting (major)"
    }
   ],
   "checks": [
    {
     "file": {
      "path": "app/requirements.txt",
      "contains": [
       "requests==2.32.3",
       "flask==2.3.3"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "answer_contains": [
      "kept",
      "major — not tried"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
